{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:17Z","created_by_operation":"op_e93dca6db99547dc89d968b7fc681568","id":"pg_1d155d9ccb0a5de6b237964401e15eaa","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/langlang03-linecodepro-readme-cn-md-247903d320ec-964401e15eaa.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_0813668e20175a9fafc9a9f66b981a75"],"title":"LangLang03/LineCodePro/README_CN.md @ 247903d320ec","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:17Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e93dca6db99547dc89d968b7fc681568"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_30069f15275d452ed3adeef6ab067285c2c290ebdf32ff136a404f2153bab3b5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Tools implement a BaseTool contract exposing name, description, category, a JSON argument schema, and an execute(JSONObject, ToolContext) returning a ToolResult."},{"claim_ids":["clm_44d2ebc2ec9121517ca04b2c3495f1b3a668c5cdf0a4c1098865e8d6e0e7b62a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors must keep app code pure Java (Kotlin stdlib excluded from the runtime classpath), place code in the lowest-level fitting module, and run testDebugUnitTest, lintDebug, assembleDebug, and assembleRelease gates before sending a PR."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4b5ebea99320ed718e66d8f900d41efa354c0574b40e587630488f157593c4fc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"LineCode Pro targets Android 8.0+ (API 26), is at version 1.2.8-max, is written in Java 11, and is licensed GPL-3.0-or-later."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4bd3d2626c543b4d832986c940672ceafcb84cf531591ab66600be1de30d2890"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The app is intentionally Java-only with no Kotlin runtime and no XML layouts, built entirely in Java 11 for transparency and reviewability."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5a97c930329a34a01bf7a27ab18273bc4361840f9a66e0d1b3d119d9bcfc7763"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Sub-agent tools (agent, agent_pipeline, agent_output) delegate work to another LLM loop, rendered with live progress cards."},{"claim_ids":["clm_60ab6a9b3954be0be934d350a18f67118469a553e7673c08d5f8e233f6cb3f8f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Every file-touching tool routes paths through FileToolPathPolicy so the model acts only inside the opened workspace; shell commands run via Termux or an IPC provider, never in the app process."},{"claim_ids":["clm_748c5d52147da8c644d03b84bf835b940dc7c0ef05a3f991661d82c2213c5e04"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Architecture: a single MainActivity hosts MainCoordinator (presenter) delegating to per-concern MVP controllers, with UI state flowing through ChatUiStateAssembler to ChatUiState to the view."},{"claim_ids":["clm_87d9a52f336a0ea000f24aae8c24b78cce48bd0b19a6d5e3a29bda873a1fde1c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The app id is cn.lineai and the project is a multi-module Gradle build with 14 modules plus :build-logic as a composite build."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8c83d89a469af673baa1ef432d34bca764201e076df54f16c19633d969dc0edb"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"ModelProtocolFactory dispatches on four protocol types: OPENAI_COMPATIBLE, CODEX_RESPONSES, ANTHROPIC_MESSAGES, and LOCAL_GGUF, each declaring capabilities like native tools and image support."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8d4c9acef5f939d6a6a664d9a038df0af9e30ea159ce3c01c315a1e02a8f7508"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Tool calls pass through PermissionModeController with automatic, confirmation, and read-only modes; confirmation supports one-time or persistent exact-match permissions scoped by mode, tool, command, and working directory."},{"claim_ids":["clm_bfc1e9a3eeb768e83b78b3d782ee10fb82ce983ac61bf14b7881d94adba72995"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"ContextCompactionService performs dynamic compaction at 50% (summarizing oldest 70%, keeping recent 30%) and 80% hard triggers, and durable knowledge saved via memory_update is reinjected next session."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cfd2231eaf340e692b62500ab7b3fdfd026e46bc7d121ceefe8590be1a667b87"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Third-party libraries include jsch for SSH, commonmark (BSD-2) for Markdown rendering, and org.json (JSON License); tests use JUnit 4 and Robolectric 4.16."}],"claim_ids":["clm_30069f15275d452ed3adeef6ab067285c2c290ebdf32ff136a404f2153bab3b5","clm_44d2ebc2ec9121517ca04b2c3495f1b3a668c5cdf0a4c1098865e8d6e0e7b62a","clm_4b5ebea99320ed718e66d8f900d41efa354c0574b40e587630488f157593c4fc","clm_4bd3d2626c543b4d832986c940672ceafcb84cf531591ab66600be1de30d2890","clm_5a97c930329a34a01bf7a27ab18273bc4361840f9a66e0d1b3d119d9bcfc7763","clm_60ab6a9b3954be0be934d350a18